title: "Replica: A replication audit of breast cancer subtype systems"
abstract: "A pre-specified audit of PAM50/Claudin-low and IntClust across TCGA-BRCA and METABRIC, with censoring-aware permutation tests, nonparametric combination, FDR control, external validation, and expression modules."
